From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mina Her <minacle@live.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 21:49:27 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Round account metadata and focus styles
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Increase link focus outline radius to 23px
- Apply pill-shaped corners to account display names
- Match account metadata rows to the rounded styling

Rationale: Align account components and focus states with the application’s rounded interface language while keeping related elements visually consistent.

